   1. HikariCP is a lightweight JDBC connection pool.
   2. It maintains reusable database connections instead of creating a new connection for every request.
   3. It improves performance by reducing connection creation overhead.
   4. We configure maximum pool size, connection timeout and idle timeout based on application workload and database capacity.

